      "id": "claim_2b0fbad9efd644dda4a0169824acaa87",
      "statement": "The backend can force a client reconnect by aborting the WebSocket session: openGadget() detects a lost connection to the workspace DO when its notifyClosed callback is disposed before being invoked, and the fetch handler implements abortSession by closing the socket via an AbortSignal.",
